cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalisation, please cite it using the metadata below, together with the paper it formalises."
type: software
title: "LionsC12: a Lean 4 formalisation of 'Lions' maximal regularity problem for divergence-form differential operators: failure at the 1/2-Hölder endpoint'"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 / Mathlib formalisation of a counterexample to maximal
  L^2-regularity in Lions' problem for divergence-form operators: a real scalar diffusion
  coefficient, 1/2-Hölder continuous in time with values in L^infinity and arbitrarily close
  to 1, for which the unique Lions variational solution with zero initial value and a
  continuous L^2-valued forcing has a time derivative that is not square integrable, on an
  interval and on every bounded domain of every dimension.
authors:
